  "body_html": "<p>Platz für die Gefolgsleute, die du unterwegs gewinnst, und die Erinnerung des Bogens daran, wofür man als Spielender hier ist. Gefolgsleute bekommen einen vollen Wertesatz, ganz ähnlich dem von Monstern, dazu einen <strong>Preis</strong> und <strong>Loyalität</strong> — siehe <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"npcs-followers.html\" data-slug=\"npcs-followers\">NSC &amp; Gefolgsleute</a>. Der HP-Zähler unter jedem Gefolgsmann wird mit dem ganzen Tisch geteilt.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-1\" data-label=\"Follower 1\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-1\">Gefolgsmann 1</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmale</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"Merkmale\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag0\"> <span><em>außergewöhnlich</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f1-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f1-tag1\"> <span><em>Gruppe</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rüstung\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Rüstung</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Schaden\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Schaden würfeln\">Schaden</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinkt</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Spielzüge</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Preis</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"was sie bei dir hält\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f1-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyalität</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyalität 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyalität 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f1-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyalität 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f1-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Ausrüstung</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notizen</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f1-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notizen\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"follower\" data-hp-key=\"follower-2\" data-label=\"Follower 2\">\n<h2 id=\"follower-2\">Gefolgsmann 2</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Name</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"Name\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Merkmale</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-tags\" placeholder=\"tags\" aria-label=\"Merkmale\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag0\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag0\"> <span><em>außergewöhnlich</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"f2-tag1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-tag1\" data-check-id=\"f2-tag1\"> <span><em>Gruppe</em></span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-max-hp\" data-default=\"6\" value=\"6\" aria-label=\"Max. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Max. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-armor\" data-default=\"0\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Rüstung\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Rüstung</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-damage\" data-default=\"d6\" value=\"d6\" aria-label=\"Schaden\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d6\" title=\"Schaden würfeln\">Schaden</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Instinkt</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-instinct\" placeholder=\"to …\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-moves\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Spielzüge</span><ol><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move0\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move1\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-move2\" placeholder=\"move\" aria-label=\"Spielzug\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ol></div>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Preis</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-cost\" placeholder=\"what keeps them following\" aria-label=\"was sie bei dir hält\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"f2-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">Loyalität</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-0\" title=\"Loyalität 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-1\" title=\"Loyalität 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"f2-loyalty-2\" title=\"Loyalität 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"f2-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"Loyalität 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-gear\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Ausrüstung</span><ul><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear0\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear1\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear2\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear3\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear4\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-gear5\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Notizen</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"followers:f2-notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"Notizen\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"players-agenda\">Agenda der Spielenden</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Stelle einen fesselnden Charakter dar</li><li>Lass dich auf die fiktive Welt ein</li><li>Spiele, um herauszufinden, was geschieht</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"players-principles\">Prinzipien der Spielenden</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Beginne und ende mit der Fiktion</li><li>Knüpfe Bande zu den anderen SC</li><li>Zeig uns, was dir wichtig ist</li><li>Hab Ziele und verfolge sie</li><li>Sei kühn, geh Risiken ein</li><li>Nimm Schwierigkeiten, Rückschläge und Scheitern an</li><li>Gestalte die Welt mit</li><li>Baue auf dem auf, was andere gesagt haben</li><li>Gib anderen Gelegenheit zu glänzen</li><li>Beteilige dich am Gespräch</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"when-in-doubt\">Im Zweifel …</h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Stell dir die Lage bildlich vor</li><li>Bitte die SL um Klärung</li><li>Was willst du? Was ist dein Ziel?</li><li>Bedenke deine Stärken und Schwächen</li><li>Hol dir Ideen von den anderen</li><li>Nimm die offensichtliche Wahl, die interessante Wahl, die bedeutsame Wahl … nicht immer die „richtige\" Wahl (denk dran: Bei einem Fehlschlag gibt es XP!)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"triggering-moves\">Spielzüge auslösen</h2>\n<p>Wenn du es tun willst, dann tu es in der Fiktion. Erzähl uns, wie du es tust, wie es aussieht. Sei konkret.</p>\n<p>Aber denk dran: Wenn du es in der Fiktion tust, dann musst du es auch tun. „Ich stürme am Hagr vorbei, um das glühende Schwert zu packen\" — und die SL sagt, das ist Gefahr trotzen mit DEX. Es ist in Ordnung zu sagen: „Oh, wirklich? Dann lasse ich es wohl.\" Aber wenn du am Hagr vorbeistürmen willst, dann her mit den Würfeln.</p>\n<h2 id=\"hold-and-spend\">Halten und ausgeben</h2>\n<p>Wenn ein Spielzug sagt „halte X [Ressource] (bis/während/solange ___)\", dann notiere die gehaltene Ressource und gib sie aus, wie der Spielzug es beschreibt. Gehaltene Ressourcen auszugeben heißt meist, dass du es einfach tust, ganz ohne Wurf.</p>\n<p>Manchmal aber erlaubt dir das Ausgeben einer gehaltenen Ressource, einen Spielzug auszulösen (und damit zu würfeln), wo du es sonst schlicht nicht gekonnt hättest.</p>"
}
